            <ArticleTitle>Respecting the dying patient's rights.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>833-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Patients who are dying have unique needs and special rights. This article discusses eight basic rights for dying patients. It also gives examples of how hospice and home care providers can focus care to respect the dying patient's rights.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
